ner>，并填写单位 mm．</p>"},"id":"q-000778","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","objectiveIds":["experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements.calculation"],"objectivesDetail":[{"anchor":"course-calculation","id":"experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements.calculation","pageId":"experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements","pageTitle":"重复测量与统计描述","title":"重复测量与统计描述：完成定量计算并检查单位","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/repeated-measurements/"}],"provenance":{"ai_assisted":true,"note":"原创教学题，数据与情境自编，AI 辅助编写．","type":"original"},"relatedPages":["experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements"],"relatedPagesDetail":[{"id":"experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements","title":"重复测量与统计描述","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/repeated-measurements/"}],"solutionHtml":"<p>平均值 10.0 mm，残差平方和 0.08 mm²，s=√(0.08/3) mm，均值标准差估计为 s/2≈0.0816497 mm；半宽 3.18245×0.0816497≈0.259846 mm．该区间只含所建模的重复性．</p>","source":{"choices":[],"stemMarkdown":"四次独立正态读数为 10.0、10.2、9.8、10.0 mm，总体标准差未知．给定双侧 95% 临界值 t(0.975,3)=3.18245，求均值置信区间的半宽，单位 mm，至少保留三位有效数字．"},"status":"published","stemHtml":"<p>四次独立正态读数为 10.0、10.2、9.8、10.0 mm，总体标准差未知．给定双侧 95% 临界值 t(0.975,3)=3.18245，求均值置信区间的半宽，单位 mm，至少保留三位有效数字．</p>","style":"computational","topicIds":["experiment.error-analysis"],"type":"numeric","version":2},{"assets":{},"authors":[{"kind":"ai","name":"Codex"}],"choiceOrder":"fixed","cognitiveLevel":"analyze","conceptIds":["measurement.repeated-measurements"],"contentFingerprint":"sha256:dd7bb9a0303910fd98dddf7572ff4e33ea14b52b24feaf3197f2ce6d52088394","difficulty":3,"estimatedSeconds":600,"feedback":{"correctHtml":"<p>请对照自评标准检查：偏离总体均值的平方和期望为 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" overflow=\"scroll\" style=\"position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"NCM-N\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B\">𝑛</mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msup><mjx-mi><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E\">𝜎</mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\">2</mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>，均值偏差平方的 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" overflow=\"scroll\" style=\"position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"NCM-N\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B\">𝑛</mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> 倍的期望为 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" overflow=\"scroll\" style=\"position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"NCM-N\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E\">𝜎</mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\">2</mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>；方差无偏不能直接推出标准差无偏．</p>","incorrectHtml":"<p>请对照自评标准补充平方和分解及两项期望，注意残差和为零消去交叉项，并区分样本方差与样本标准差的无偏性．</p>"},"grading":{"mode":"self_assessed","rubric":[{"id":"incomplete","label":"尚未掌握：未建立平方和分解或混淆方差与标准差．","points":0},{"id":"partial","label":"部分掌握：给出分解或自由度解释，但缺少期望计算、独立同方差条件或无偏性的限定．","points":0.5},{"id":"complete","label":"基本掌握：说明残差和为零，写出平方和分解及两项期望，得到 n−1 并区分 s² 与 s 的无偏性．","points":1}]},"id":"q-000779","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","objectiveIds":["experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements.analysis"],"objectivesDetail":[{"anchor":"course-analysis","id":"experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements.analysis","pageId":"experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements","pageTitle":"重复测量与统计描述","title":"重复测量与统计描述：说明方法、结果与限制","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/repeated-measurements/"}],"provenance":{"ai_assisted":true,"note":"原创教学题，数据与情境自编，AI 辅助编写．","type":"original"},"referenceAnswerHtml":"<p>将偏离总体均值的平方和分解为残差平方和与 n 倍均值偏差平方；取期望得 (n−1)σ²，故 s² 无偏，而 s 不一般无偏．</p>","relatedPages":["experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements"],"relatedPagesDetail":[{"id":"experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements","title":"重复测量与统计描述","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/repeated-measurements/"}],"response":{"format":"plain_text","max_chars":12000,"min_chars":1,"placeholder":"写出恒等式、取期望及结论．","required":true,"rows":8},"solutionHtml":"<p>利用 Σ(Xᵢ−μ)²=Σ(Xᵢ−X̄)²+n(X̄−μ)²，残差和为零消去交叉项．独立同方差给 Var(X̄)=σ²/n，取期望后得到 E[Σ(Xᵢ−X̄)²]=(n−1)σ²．因此 s²=Σ(Xᵢ−X̄)²/(n−1) 是 σ² 的无偏估计．平方根是非线性运算，不能由此断言 s 对 σ 无偏．</p>","source":{"choices":[],"stemMarkdown":"设观测相互独立同分布，均值 μ、有限方差 σ² 均未知．推导残差平方和期望，并说明为何样本方差除以 n−1；你的推导是否表明样本标准差无偏？"},"status":"published","stemHtml":"<p>设观测相互独立同分布，均值 μ、有限方差 σ² 均未知．推导残差平方和期望，并说明为何样本方差除以 n−1；你的推导是否表明样本标准差无偏？</p>","style":"modeling","topicIds":["experiment.error-analysis"],"type":"free_response","version":2}],"runnable":true,"schemaVersion":3,"selectionAlgorithmVersion":1,"set":{"authors":[{"kind":"ai","name":"Codex"}],"description":"15 道草稿练习，覆盖重复测量的数值计算、置信区间和推导自评．","feedback_mode":"immediate","id":"experiment.error-analysis.repeated-measurements","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","provenance":{"ai_assisted":true,"note":"对应误差分析课程的固定教学题集，题目均为原创草稿．","type":"original"},"schema_version":1,"selection":{"order":"fixed","questions":["q-000130","q-000131","q-000132","q-000133","q-000134","q-000135","q-000136","q-000137","q-000138","q-000139","q-000140","q-000141","q-000777","q-000778","q-000779"],"type":"fixed"},"status":"published","tags":["误差分析与数据处理","重复测量与统计描述"],"title":"重复测量与统计描述：专题习题","version":2},"unavailableReason":null}